(7512755, 1199315, 30982, '<td valign="top">First thought that came to mind was holy (expletive deleted), so I''ll just say holy cow!  Gotta love that architecture and detail.  Will come back to see where this is.</td>', 'First thought that came to mind was holy (expletive deleted), so I''ll just say holy cow!  Gotta love that architecture and detail.  Will come back to see where this is.', '2017-05-09 00:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512756, 1199037, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool that the window washers were out that day!</td>', 'Very cool that the window washers were out that day!', '2017-05-09 00:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512757, 1199442, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love that old glass.</td>', 'Love that old glass.', '2017-05-09 00:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512828, 1199124, 150202, '<td valign="top">Neat composition, although I don''t see much light which causes it to seem a bit flat for me.</td>', 'Neat composition, although I don''t see much light which causes it to seem a bit flat for me.', '2017-05-09 09:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512829, 1199417, 150202, '<td valign="top">The three cranes are really neat to see, but the darkness of the photo doesn''t do it for me.  I like the flags going across too!</td>', 'The three cranes are really neat to see, but the darkness of the photo doesn''t do it for me.  I like the flags going across too!', '2017-05-09 09:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512830, 1199437, 150202, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset.  The buildings seem a bit dark to me personally, but I really like the colors of the sky.</td>', 'Pretty sunset.  The buildings seem a bit dark to me personally, but I really like the colors of the sky.', '2017-05-09 09:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512831, 1199431, 150202, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of the women looking outside as a silhouette.  I think the brightness outside, with the bird feeder is a bit too bright or something, maybe too much of the window and not enough of the woman.  The emotion you captured is great.</td>', 'I really like the concept of the women looking outside as a silhouette.  I think the brightness outside, with the bird feeder is a bit too bright or something, maybe too much of the window and not enough of the woman.  The emotion you captured is great.', '2017-05-09 09:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512832, 1199342, 150202, '<td valign="top">Cute window.  The composition doesn''t excite me much personally.  The photo is nice and sharp, which I like.</td>', 'Cute window.  The composition doesn''t excite me much personally.  The photo is nice and sharp, which I like.', '2017-05-09 09:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512833, 1199445, 150202, '<td valign="top">The building is really neat, but it kind of blends in with the sky, which doesn''t grab my attention.  Nice sharpness all the way through the building.</td>', 'The building is really neat, but it kind of blends in with the sky, which doesn''t grab my attention.  Nice sharpness all the way through the building.', '2017-05-09 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512836, 1199409, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the vanishing point of the street to emphasize the architecture.  There''s a little too much street in the foreground for my tastes, and of course rotation and a title would help some too!</td>', 'I like how you captured the vanishing point of the street to emphasize the architecture.  There''s a little too much street in the foreground for my tastes, and of course rotation and a title would help some too!', '2017-05-09 09:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512837, 1199410, 150202, '<td valign="top">The blue cast doesn''t win me over on this one.  Neat composition.</td>', 'The blue cast doesn''t win me over on this one.  Neat composition.', '2017-05-09 09:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512890, 1198835, 104230, '<td valign="top">Now that''s more like it! Rock and architecture. Showing how light can enhance the form of the structure.  My highest vote so far.</td>', 'Now that''s more like it! Rock and architecture. Showing how light can enhance the form of the structure.  My highest vote so far.', '2017-05-09 17:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512892, 1198937, 104230, '<td valign="top">An interesting placement of windows, and visually stark looking building.<br/> <br/>However, I don''t understand why you chose to shoot an elevation (a 2-dimensional view of one side of the building) for this challenge. That plus the very flat light produce something that is flat in both form and light, which IMO is the antithesis of what this challenge is about.  Not voting.</td>', 'An interesting placement of windows, and visually stark looking building. However, I don''t understand why you chose to shoot an elevation (a 2-dimensional view of one side of the building) for this challenge. That plus the very flat light produce something that is flat in both form and light, which IMO is the antithesis of what this challenge is about.  Not voting.', '2017-05-09 18:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512893, 1199021, 104230, '<td valign="top">Yes, light enhancing our appreciation of the form. Fun title!</td>', 'Yes, light enhancing our appreciation of the form. Fun title!', '2017-05-09 18:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512938, 1198905, 94815, '<td valign="top">Has the drama of an old sci-fi movie like "Things to Come". Good conjuring. 8</td>', 'Has the drama of an old sci-fi movie like "Things to Come". Good conjuring. 8', '2017-05-09 21:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7512939, 1199021, 94815, '<td valign="top">Difficult subject to photograph but you did it justice. 7</td>', 'Difficult subject to photograph but you did it justice. 7', '2017-05-09 21:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
